      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Please, things ain't always what they seem to be",
          "rhyme":"ab",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"'Cause, me, I got dreams to be the greatest MC",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Muhammad Ali with punchlines that sting like a bee",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"But I float like a butterfly, prove this nation I'm the god",
          "rhyme":"ud",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"What am I? A coward, only if I run from God? (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"ud",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"From the bottom I came, to the top of my game",
          "rhyme":"Ejm",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Rippin' and spittin' licks off the top of the brain (Uh)",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"I spit heat, fireman, why you stoppin' my flames?",
          "rhyme":"am",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Nothin' makes sense, so you can find me shoppin' for change",
          "rhyme":"#Z",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"It's comin' from Nas, he told us that the world is ours",
          "rhyme":"uRs",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"I spit SARS, can't talk, gotta lock my jaws",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"I got the Earth in my paws, and the stars in my eyes",
          "rhyme":"Ej",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDDEFGHIJK",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABBCCDEAFCGD"
    },
    {
