    {
      "section_id":"section_4",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"See, in the Steel City we don't feel pity on you itsy bitsy",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Gypsies (Nope) that feel pretty chill and heal quickly",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"And we deal midis and anything to get the cheese",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"We also got the haze if you tryna get skeed (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"But if you want the weed, needa talk to me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"'Cause I be on my grind like some coffee beans (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"ins",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"And we hear no evil, see no evil, speak no evil, streets is lethal",
          "rhyme":"al",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Fiends with needles, lead the people, Nas came first, now read the sequel (Woo)",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Should be illegal, but a legendary, all is secondary",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"More vocabulary than a dictionary (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"I'm a visionary, in time the world will be mine",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Until then, I fill it with rhymes and leave it behind",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Way behind 'til my state of mind is clearer",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Lookin' at the cross hangin' on your rear-view mirror",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"'Cause mankind actin' pure and divine",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"So I proceed to MC 'til the world is mine",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AABCDEFGAAHIBJHH",
